<h2>AI-KAI: RAG-Based Chatbot System</h2>
<p>
  This project involved building a Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) chatbot system
  for Kajaani University of Applied Sciences (KAMK). The system automatically scrapes,
  indexes, and retrieves website content to provide intelligent, context-aware answers
  about university programs, admissions, and campus services.
</p>

<h3>Key Accomplishments</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Designed and implemented a <strong>microservices architecture</strong> with 8 independent services orchestrated via Docker Compose.</li>
  <li>Built a complete <strong>RAG pipeline</strong>: web scraping → text chunking → vector embeddings → semantic search → LLM response generation.</li>
  <li>Integrated <strong>ChromaDB</strong> for vector storage and <strong>Sentence Transformers</strong> for 384-dimensional embeddings.</li>
  <li>Implemented <strong>privacy-aware scraping</strong> with automatic filtering of personal data (names, emails, phone numbers).</li>
  <li>Developed an <strong>API Gateway</strong> to orchestrate service communication with proper timeout handling and health monitoring.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Tools & Technologies</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Python</strong>, <strong>FastAPI</strong>, <strong>Uvicorn</strong> for backend services.</li>
  <li><strong>Sentence Transformers</strong>, <strong>ChromaDB</strong>, <strong>Poro LLM</strong> for AI/ML components.</li>
  <li><strong>Docker</strong>, <strong>Docker Compose</strong> for containerization and orchestration.</li>
  <li><strong>DuckDB</strong>, <strong>BeautifulSoup4</strong>, <strong>httpx</strong> for data handling and scraping.</li>
  <li><strong>GitLab CI/CD</strong>, <strong>Pylint</strong>, <strong>Pytest</strong> for quality assurance and automation.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Challenges & Outcome</h3>
<p>
  Coordinating 8 microservices while ensuring embedding model consistency across distributed
  components required careful architectural planning. Balancing privacy protection with data
  utility added complexity to the scraping pipeline. The final solution delivers accurate,
  context-aware responses while maintaining ethical web scraping practices and GDPR compliance.
</p>
